@startuml BackupRestoreSequence
!include style.puml
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

participant ":EqmManager" as Manager
participant ":BackupHandler" as Backup
participant "backup files" as Source
participant "staging directory" as Stage
participant "live data files" as Live
participant "equipment, loan and\nbundle handlers" as Handlers

Manager -> Backup: restoreBackup(input)
activate Backup
Backup -> Source: read files and verify manifest
activate Source
Source --> Backup: snapshot
deactivate Source
Backup -> Stage: writeLiveFiles(snapshot)
activate Stage
Stage --> Backup
deactivate Stage
Backup -> Handlers: load staged equipment and loans
activate Handlers
Handlers --> Backup: validated records
deactivate Handlers
note over Stage, Handlers
Temporary handlers validate the staged records
before any live file is replaced.
end note
Backup -> Live: capture original files
activate Live
Live --> Backup: original snapshots
deactivate Live
Backup -> Live: replace equipment, loans and sequence
activate Live
Live --> Backup
deactivate Live
Backup -> Handlers: clear and save bundles; reload handlers
activate Handlers
alt replacement, bundle clearing or reload fails
    Handlers --> Backup: failure
    deactivate Handlers
    loop captured original files
        Backup -> Live: restore()
        Live --> Backup
    end
    Backup -> Handlers: reload restored records
    Handlers --> Backup
    Backup --> Manager: BackupUnsuccessful
else all changes succeed
    Handlers --> Backup: reloaded state
    deactivate Handlers
    Backup --> Manager: source path
end
deactivate Backup
@enduml
